    {
      "@id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:60954ffafd2a73b239119fea4a06d5208291500748129c97e8cc589cc20f7343",
      "@type": "rkaf:Artifact",
      "rkaf:hasArtifactIdentifier": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:60954ffafd2a73b239119fea4a06d5208291500748129c97e8cc589cc20f7343",
      "rkaf:artifactIdentifierScheme": "rkaf:urn-persistent",
      "rkaf:hasContentDigest": "sha256:5e31267121c8cb80911fa11695aa8a79fbba00bc2d6b30da428378a15a946738",
      "dcterms:format": "application/json",
      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:285959247bcc0c82e028b429f2bd5d70417634c00e3d4fb898f83685ace7a2ee\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ee11eecc282587825f1b36dd3b5891519bbb42dbef6ba467413bf0061c7e8970\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a32075fb72adc23565b41cfd58129c9910e359321764d044e9ed1676bc81f7bc\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:81be9740df0d686f315f8711e6509954b4403b3bcc3ad236491880f74ec8e7e7\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:0289e27394635a7b784939a5cce307bb06a4795eb6b6daff7e0a2716ba2688da\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:779cc1cd1b2a36a1d488c4d644cc40587cc59235c278e14b4e751cd157f12065\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:9d69c184b5b63248526355bd57f6186e557497bd18ee495fb55d79d97fb7c944\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3b66632ab2fba2b82c709bc63eec22a78265390db7f224503e8d46810e7110bc\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:2884beb8a4271a9fe651ece2f4eb13b5ab985758cbd3013342a43fbfab17ab3a\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"choice_text\":\"Applies if the individual is any of the following: (1) law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while performing law enforcement duty at the airport; (2) an individual authorized to carry a weapon under §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or 49 CFR part 1562 subpart B; or (3) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":988,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":988,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:988:sha256-9b176610a451fc252606e5feec7a890a0e3330de336680f39d2efb15eb504cc3\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":900,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:886:900:sha256-533232681eac9dd2c357af3b24908d4c4e8d41562c911ad7ed51eb0f4638ccd0\",\"quote\":\"does not apply\",\"start\":886},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":1129,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:990:1129:sha256-f63ba4358ff966ac514283f276f0c32e86dfc525ab2beea862985bb4ee9e53da\",\"quote\":\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"start\":990},{\"end\":1282,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1131:1282:sha256-9ab3e271d6219176b18a908e1e89635a5cbfeb67fd6a395dd3bcf59d3ad942c1\",\"quote\":\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"start\":1131},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1284:1374:sha256-767b73a5ca31a741e65fb7e179b443fe99e4fac4dbe40a0ca0c7e7df93cee56a\",\"quote\":\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":1284}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:60954ffafd2a73b239119fea4a06d5208291500748129c97e8cc589cc20f7343\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"exemption\",\"logic_text\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:2884beb8a4271a9fe651ece2f4eb13b5ab985758cbd3013342a43fbfab17ab3a\",\"modality\":\"not_required\",\"modality_quote\":\"does not apply\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:11b7cc54c01ad6d2b5cf729f1025684eb66a563ab4febf4fe7416b80ffeb2427\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"references\":[\"§ 1540.111(a)\",\"§ 1544.219\",\"§ 1544.221\",\"§ 1544.223\",\"§ 1546.211\",\"49 CFR part 1562 subpart B\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:479b169e4b5f23e67b1874a308b24600afa668a1702978031a8f1a4c91462d4c\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\"],\"scope_text\":\"As to carriage of firearms and other weapons on an individual's person or accessible property, if the individual is qualifying law enforcement personnel or an authorized individual under specified provisions or a security program.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":771,\"summary\":\"Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport; an individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter; or an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
      "dcterms:references": [
