baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1376,\"summary\":\"A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter any loaded firearm(s).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
