      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ffeb2df69c99cc4bad5984b2b3028558304404bd07147a32b240ee14f9b83f48\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ca5fbb31138b0f978381da833cf08caf5e576915647a16cbdf9202088df1ab93\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:49da2a2c73b1afbdb69b27fc5f8608ff2bac4105b0350dd6d37b12afca6d5fb3\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:36a38b6a882c0861ef2e18ddabcbe2fdf336c9d4ce115ac6654622aa9baccfbd\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4ab056bf4afcc93bd432dd97a7089a0601f9c8f9b3550651039f53303caf9a2b\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c48c06346ee20be02f1bea4a741d20ed735ddf4464c6be6af4c964a8317fa46e\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1b2c7b5d16b96068c8df836018fcc834f868ae133ce524b10467fd09aebf0a58\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\",\"choice_text\":\"The passenger must declare to the aircraft operator either orally or in writing before checking the baggage.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":1621,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":1621,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1586:1621:sha256-a03b234b39a7e3d902b46246302bd2c0d5986a277e51dcd12feeb18f5483f16c\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\",\"start\":1586},{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1586:2010:sha256-55445821b85174dd35baccbe029635bc4b535d4c2fb27e8faef334a78e47a106\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1586},{\"end\":1809,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1623:1809:sha256-f6fe03740da837c967d5e1a19cc83bd62f4517d0b086d968201a40859ccf0a16\",\"quote\":\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\",\"start\":1623},{\"end\":1556,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1376:1556:sha256-9dd5c9d0feb251838bff5c1a16b3c099ef083ecc7b0fca10625f4c8d5699fdf1\",\"quote\":\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\",\"start\":1376},{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"scope_text:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1586:2010:sha256-55445821b85174dd35baccbe029635bc4b535d4c2fb27e8faef334a78e47a106\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1586},{\"end\":1809,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1623:1809:sha256-f6fe03740da837c967d5e1a19cc83bd62f4517d0b086d968201a40859ccf0a16\",\"quote\":\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\",\"start\":1623}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:8d5bd055a8e81109ce0fb6ecd555c9cb983cc8ff57ec4f77ffcbf4c1424060b2\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1b2c7b5d16b96068c8df836018fcc834f868ae133ce524b10467fd09aebf0a58\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:a62129176d3fad7d254c17336834edad31b0a04c6a19cf0cdf997b66ac8b9f91\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\",\"references\":[\"§ 1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:5f58ffc3fe3102200d9a60d9d906f08c9630ba14e1bace0e1457d1990d7a48d4\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\",\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\"],\"scope_text\":\"In checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter, for any unloaded firearm(s), unless all four conditions in paragraphs (c)(2)(i) through (iv) are satisfied.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1586,\"summary\":\"A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter any unloaded firearm(s) unless the passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded; the firearm is unloaded; the firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and the container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
